# Resource: aws_redshift_snapshot_schedule

## Example Usage

```terraform
resource "aws_redshift_snapshot_schedule" "default" {
  identifier = "tf-redshift-snapshot-schedule"
  definitions = [
    "rate(12 hours)",
  ]
}
```

